r |&lt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tp|\n\t\t\t\t\t\tq > | plays the role of determining the measure of distinguishability of |\n\t\t\t\t\t\tp > and |\n\t\t\t\t\t\tq > if a classification with certainty is required.", "abstract_source_suggest": {"input": "Elsevier B.V."}}], "refereed": true, "titles": [{"source": "Elsevier B.V.", "title": "Overlap and distinguishability of quantum states"}], "facet_author_name": ["1065719_Dennis Dieks"], "core": false, "imprints": [{"date": "2002-09-19"}], "_oai": {"sets": ["Literature"], "id": "oai:inspirehep.net:2801062", "updated": "2024-06-23T12:15:46.293588"}, "curated": false, "journal_title_variants": ["Phys.Lett.A", "Phys. Lett. A"]}, "id": "2801062", "created": "2024-06-23T12:15:44.740556+00:00", "updated": "2024-06-23T12:15:46.293588+00:00"}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1", "bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1&format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1&format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1&format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1016%2F0375-9601%2888%2990840-7&size=5&page=1&format=cv"}}